  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARCHIVED ADF-16 Climate Action Fund (payments) (FT 30 million)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A &#xA3;200m bilateral contribution through the AfDB&#x2019;s new Climate Action Window, which will allow FCDO to use the Bank&#x2019;s capacity to scale up efforts to tackle the impact of climate change on the poorest countries across Africa and secure more reach and impact than through direct management. This will support UK investments to strengthen global food security and invest in clean and green infrastructure and mobilise more donor support alongside.</narrative>
  </description>
